title: "apol1-alphagenome: analysis code and frozen results"
message: >-
  If you use this archive, cite both this record and the paper it supports.
  Note that the licence differs between the code and the model-derived data;
  see LICENSE and LEGALLY_BINDING_TERMS_OF_USE.txt.
type: software
authors:
