repository-code: "https://github.com/PatientThread/apol1-alphagenome"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, frozen allele ledger, per-variant AlphaGenome predictions,
  contingency counts, ENCODE peak and track manifests, ranking provenance,
  change-in-contrast estimates and bootstrap stability tables supporting
  "Reference choice affects positional enrichment of AlphaGenome variant
  rankings at APOL1-MYH9".
keywords:
  - APOL1
  - AlphaGenome
  - DNase-seq
  - chromatin accessibility
  - variant prioritisation
  - reference selection
